<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa in, thutak a ka it mahmah numei hoih, tel a omnu leh a tate kiang ah; kei kia hilou in, thutak thei peuhmahte’n a hon it uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thutak eimah a om gige, tangtawn a i kiang ua om gige ding a hih ziak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist, Pa Tapa kiang a kipan hehpihna, zahngaihna, lemna thutak leh itna in noute hon ompih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pa kiang a kipan a thupiak i muh bang in na ta kuate hiam thutak a om a ka muh ziak in ka kipak mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numei hoih, na kiang a thupiak thak gelh hilou in, a tung a kipan a i neihpen gelhzaw in, i ki-ittuah theihna ding in nget petmah in k’on ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan hiai itna ahi, a thupiak bangzel a i omna uh. Hiai ahi thupiak a tung a kipat a na zak uh, huai ah na om ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khemmi tampi Jesu Khrist sa in a hongpai chih gumlou khovel ah a hong pawtta uhi. Tua mite ahi, khemmi leh Khrist doumi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I sepkhiaksate mangsaklou a, a kipahman bukim a i muh theihna ding un, nangmah kiveng hoih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai thu kihilhna thu a om gige lou a talek in Pathian a neikei; huai thu kihilhna thu a a om gige in Pa leh Tapa a neikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai thu kihilhna thu hon pawlou a, na kiang ua a hongpai leh na inn uah tungsak kei unla, paukam hoih in kha kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paukam hoih a khami a thil hihkhelh ah a pangsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kiang ua thu tampi gen ding ka neih ziak in lai leh laitui a gelh ka ut kei a; na kipahna uh a kim theihna ding in na kiang ua hong a, kimaituah a kihou ka lamen zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sanggamnu tel tate un chibai a honbuk uhi, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
